        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " arasubira abarira Mose ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ucurishe ibesani mu butare bw’umwakaka, n’ivyo kuyihagarikako bicuzwe mu mwakaka nyene, ize ibe iyo gukarabiramwo. Uzoyitereke hagati y’ihema ry’ibonaniro n’igicaniro, uyisukemwo amazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni n’abahungu biwe abe ari yo bazokoresha mu gukaraba iminwe no kwoza ibirenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe cose bazoba bagomba kwinjira mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, bazobanze kwisukura kugira ngo ntibapfe. Kandi igihe bazoba begereye igicaniro ngo bampereze ibimazi vyanshikaniwe bituriwe n’umuriro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bazokarabe iminwe, boze n’ibirenge vyabo kugira ngo ntibapfe. Iki kizobe icagezwe c’intahava kuri Aroni n’uruvyaro rwiwe uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikira urundi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
